WEBVTT

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.370
<i>Today... Today's the day...</i>

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.120
<i>I'll make it there.</i>

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.000
<i>Today's the day...</i>

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>I don't think I can go on anymore.</i>

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:40.000
<i>Yokai and such are imaginary characters.</i>

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.260
<i>They don't actually exist.</i>

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.020
<i>Right...</i>

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.390
<i>Until that day, that's what I believed.</i>

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:22.450
<b>Mystery One: The Beginning</b>

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:19.050
<i>Several days earlier...</i>

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.760
Hanae! Hanae, are you there?

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:22.490
Yeah?

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.330
Could you go grocery shopping for dinner?

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:27.880
Sure.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:32.080
Thanks. I'm so busy with 
the school year starting.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.340
Ta-da!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.250
I expressed a mother's joy 
at having a fine son

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.270
with a bouquet of flowers.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.840
Please stop expressing your 
emotions with flowers!

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:45.100
Bell peppers, carrots, eggs...

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.480
Good. I don't think I forgot anything.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.520
Oh, it's just a stuffed animal.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.000
That scared me.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.570
<i>Did some kid drop it?</i>

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.360
Now no one will step on it,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:05.400
and it'll be easier for its owner to find.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.430
I did a good deed.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.120
Now that I'm in high school as of tomorrow,

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.210
I've really matured.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.890
Wh-What?

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.310
Wh-What is this thing?

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.510
I'm home...

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.100
Welcome home. That took a while.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:45.880
You look pale.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.150
Did something happen?

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.920
More than just something.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.340
This weird thing stuck itself to me.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.840
What stuck to you?

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.670
This thing.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.040
What thing?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:57.910
Huh?

00:03:58.550 --> 00:03:59.980
Crocuses.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.230
In the language of flowers,

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.550
they mean, "I believe you, 
but I'm worried about you."

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.390
<i>She can't see it?</i>

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.890
<i>Why?</i>

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:14.170
<i>Headache, nausea, full-body fatigue...</i>

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.830
<i>I'm so unsteady on my feet, 
I can't even walk straight...</i>

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.590
<i>As far as I can tell,</i>

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.810
<i>I'm the only one who can see it.</i>

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.590
<i>I'm almost at school...</i>

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:29.490
Entrance 
Ceremony

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.000
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:34.120
Cold!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:38.980
An ice pack?

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.500
Are you okay?

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.210
Is this the nurse's office?

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:48.380
Yes. You collapsed in 
front of the school gate.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:49.600
Sorry!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.140
There's no need to rush.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.790
Classes have already ended.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:54.420
Huh?

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:56.310
What?!

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.080
<i>I can't believe I spent my entire</i>

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.820
<i>first day of high school in the nurse's office.</i>

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:12.600
<i>On top of that, I still feel terrible.</i>

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.990
<i>No matter how you look at it, 
the reason for it must be...</i>

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.710
This fuzzy thing!

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:20.420
<i>I'm sure of it! This thing is a yokai!</i>

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.750
Get off of me!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.470
Enough already!

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.470
Wh-What is he doing?

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.300
We should keep our distance.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.260
<i>The second day.</i>

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:42.040
Okay, I made it past the gate.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:45.080
Now my high school life will finally...

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.240
Someone collapsed!

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.900
Take him to the nurse's office!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.730
<i>The third day.</i>

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:54.570
Someone collapsed!

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.080
Get him to the nurse's office!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.130
<i>The fourth day.</i>

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.460
What's wrong with you? 
Need to go to the nurse's office?

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:01.900
<i>The fifth day.</i>

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.840
Are you sure you're okay?

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.460
I-I'm fine...

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.120
When I was younger,

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.840
I used to collapse from anemia all the time.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.360
Do you think it's genetic?

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:16.350
I-I'm off.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.100
In the language of flowers, red gerberas mean,

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.480
"always give your all and challenge yourself!"

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.240
You can do it!

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:32.530
<i>That's right... I have to give everything I have.</i>

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.040
<i>Everything I have...</i>

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.100
<i>Everything...</i>

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.860
I'm almost at my classroom.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:49.040
My high school life will finally...

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:51.680
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.960
<i>I can't believe I've spent</i>

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:57.390
<i>my entire high school career 
since the entrance ceremony here.</i>

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:01.400
<i>I've been feeling worse and worse 
since this thing showed up,</i>

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:05.000
<i>and it keeps getting bigger.</i>

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.360
<i>It's clearly sucking something out of me.</i>

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.150
<i>He's going to curse me to death!</i>

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.910
Damn it! I refuse to be cursed to death!

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.720
<i>At this rate, I won't make a single friend.</i>

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:21.270
<i>I'll be a loner. A gloomy 
high school life awaits me.</i>

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:23.320
No way!

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:28.540
I did it!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.040
I-I tore...

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.680
<b>Now Hiring
Exorcists!!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.720
Exorcists?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.980
Brush your teeth!!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:48.040
I have zero judgment right now.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:53.400
<i>I'm sure they'll just mock 
me for taking it seriously.</i>

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:59.240
<i>But if there's even a 0.1% chance 
I'll escape this fuzzball,</i>

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:02.060
<i>I'll do whatever it takes!</i>

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.620
Yes? Who's calling?

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:05.700
<i>He picked up!</i>

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.560
Is this Abeno-san?

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:08.890
It is.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:12.120
I saw your "help wanted" poster...

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.180
Ah, so you "saw" that paper?

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.100
I didn't think anyone would actually call.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.680
Anyway, uh...

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.560
Come for an interview immediately.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:21.580
Huh?

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:23.720
Where are you right now?

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.780
The nurse's office.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:28.990
Okay, open the nurse's office door.

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:29.570
Huh?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.540
Where should I go from here?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.120
You'll know once you open the door.

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:35.760
Huh?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.570
<i>Is he already waiting outside?</i>

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.460
Have a seat.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:52.010
<b>The Morose Mononokean</b>

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.120
Come in.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.400
Uh, okay...

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.020
It shrank!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.540
Hurry up and come in.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.170
Take off your shoes.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:08.900
Okay.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.400
<i>Has the room next to the nurse's 
office always been a tea room?</i>

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.360
Here.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.500
Um, are you...

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:24.160
Yeah, I'm this Mononokean's 
master, Abeno Haruitsuki.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.190
So, when can you start work?

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:26.920
Huh?

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:33.170
You look pretty weak, but no one 
else responded, so you'll do.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.480
That's not why I'm here.

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.510
I actually called because I need your help.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.630
What? Help?

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:45.230
This fuzzy thing's possessed me
and it's causing huge problems!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.520
When I saw your notice, I thought maybe...

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:52.380
you'd be able to exorcise it...

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:56.300
Sure, I'll exorcise it.

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.910
Really? Thank you so much!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.840
You really thought I'd say that?

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.120
Get out of here, weakling.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:06.870
What?!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.090
Hold on!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.500
What are you doing? Let go!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.380
Can't you do something?!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.500
I let you in because I thought 
you wanted to work.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.950
If you want an exorcism, 
then wait your turn.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.120
The other customers come first.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.040
Other customers?

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.740
How long will I have to wait?

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:22.600
Ten days.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:23.970
Ten days?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.850
If you can't wait, do 
something about it yourself.

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.350
I'll wait.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.360
<i>Will I still be alive in ten days?</i>

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:36.990
Then I'll put you on the waiting list.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.330
What's your name?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.360
Ashiya Hanae.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:42.620
Ashiya?

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.520
"Ashiya," huh?

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.230
Yes, it's Ashiya.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:49.620
Wh-What is it?

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:56.650
Fine. I'll exorcise that thing now.

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:58.880
What? Really?

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:01.890
I changed my mind.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.600
You leave first. I'll follow you.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.760
Okay.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.790
Huh? There's no door.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.250
Take the door at your feet when you leave.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.150
It's tiny! Take this thing?

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:20.780
<i>What the hell is going on here?</i>

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.300
What? The roof?

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:27.840
What's going on?

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:29.790
Shut up. Don't shout.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.900
The nurse's office is on the first floor, 
and now we're on the roof?

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:36.600
I'm starting to feel dizzy...

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.830
Wait, huh?!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.800
It grew?! It's heavy!

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.060
It's pretty huge.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.550
I can't stand this!

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:47.930
I'm going to die today if 
this thing sticks around!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.760
Abeno-san, please get rid of it!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:52.080
Stop hitting it.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.530
Be quiet for a bit.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:02.990
<i>What is that?</i>

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:06.140
<i>His expression suddenly turned grim.</i>

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.820
<i>Is it a tool for some exorcising technique?</i>

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.500
<i>Is it...</i>

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:13.500
<i>a dangerous spell?</i>

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.350
Blowing up a beach ball is really tough.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:21.880
<i>He's just out of breath?!</i>

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.510
Can you exorcise this thing with that?

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.260
What? I'm going to play with this.

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.870
What are you even saying?!

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.830
I can't take it anymore!

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.770
Are you just mocking me?

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:42.300
Are you having fun teasing me 
while I desperately beg for help?!

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:43.280
Piss off!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.780
I knew it.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.680
You're just like the others.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.760
Huh?

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.610
Just so you know,

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:56.790
I don't care if you suffer or die.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.300
I don't do it for people.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.550
I exorcise yokai for their sake.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.210
I can see you, too.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.310
So would you like to play with me?

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:31.290
It left!

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:34.160
Somehow I feel good.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.540
I don't have a headache 
or nausea or anything!

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.580
Amazing.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.320
Hey.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.220
Why do you think he was possessing you?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.470
Despite your punching and kicking,

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.970
why do you think it clung to you?

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:58.780
Probably because I stepped on its tail,
so it held a grudge against me.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:02.150
If it wanted to kill you, 
you'd already be dead.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.400
Why, then?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:12.120
I've met yokai like this one a few times.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.120
Animals that were kept by people

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.910
and became yokai after they died.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:21.540
Even after becoming yokai, 
they wag their tails and do tricks,

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:23.920
but eventually they realize

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:28.280
no one's looking at them.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:34.320
Most people in this world can't see yokai.

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:37.080
As long as they're here, they're alone.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.940
So when he met

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.440
someone who didn't ignore him, he was happy.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.200
And, determined to never be alone again,

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.200
he desperately clung to you.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.210
<i>Even if I punched or kicked him,</i>

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.870
<i>it was better than being ignored.</i>

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:01.860
<i>There was no way for me to know</i>

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.970
<i>that's why he possessed me.</i>

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.150
<i>It was hairy, creepy,</i>

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.370
<i>and kept getting bigger.</i>

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:17.290
<i>And I was afraid because 
I got sick after it showed up.</i>

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:22.090
<i>It wasn't human, but it felt "human" 
emotions like loneliness and joy.</i>

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.900
<i>I'd never even considered the idea.</i>

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:28.920
<i>I never tried to see him. 
It's no wonder I didn't understand.</i>

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.400
Abeno-san,

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:35.040
is there anything I can do for him?

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.940
Let's play, Ashiya.

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:47.770
I'll return him to the "Underworld," 
where he belongs.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.610
That's what it means to "exorcise" a yokai.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:53.200
But he's a little too big for an exorcism.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.760
To make him smaller, we have 
to give him what he wants.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.060
He says he wants to play.

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:08.410
<i>Oh, I get it. That's why he had a beach ball.</i>

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:12.040
<i>Abeno-san understood everything.</i>

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.570
You can at least throw a ball 
around with him, right?

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.250
Keep playing until he's satisfied.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.370
That's what he wants, right?

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.170
Okay! Let's go, Fuzzy!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:34.300
Here we go!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.420
<i>Five hours later...</i>

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:42.280
I can't move anymore.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.860
That should be small enough.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.930
Let's exorcise him before it gets dark.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.370
What are you going to do?

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.860
Just watch and see.

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.870
Mononokean master, Abeno Haruitsuki,

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.860
requesting a portal to the Underworld.

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.710
Incredible.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.930
This is the entrance to the Underworld.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:17.340
It's a little foreboding. 
Is it safe to go in there?

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:21.890
It's more habitable inside for yokai. 
Besides, he'll have friends.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.320
Oh, right.

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:26.440
If you understand, then bring him here.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.380
Okay.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.350
<i>I wanted you to go away,</i>

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:36.990
<i>but now I'm reluctant to let you go.</i>

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.500
Sorry I had the wrong idea about you.

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.790
I'm sorry for hitting and kicking you.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.240
Don't go, Fuzzy!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.340
What are you doing? Get away from him.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.350
I'm closing the door.

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:04.350
See ya.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.640
Thank you.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:07.350
Huh?

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:12.260
Abeno-san...

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.880
Did you just say, "thank you"?

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.780
Why would I thank you?

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.840
You're quite a conscientious yokai.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.250
You don't need to thank me.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.860
You'll have friends in the Underworld. 
Don't worry, just go on.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.270
Take care.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:10.200
Abeno-san!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.510
I apologize!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.290
Huh?

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.360
It was rude of me to claim that you

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.470
couldn't exorcise it or 
that you were mocking me.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.800
It's fine. I'm used to it.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.320
You're actually a good person, aren't you?

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:26.060
Huh?

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.920
You played with the fuzzball.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.530
Despite everything, you helped me.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.950
Seriously, thank you so much.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.190
I don't need your thanks. It's annoying.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.750
Don't be so shy.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.300
I'm not shy.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:46.170
Don't thank me. Just pay up.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.830
That'll be a million.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.770
A million yen?! It costs that much?!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:51.800
Of course.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.270
I'm a high school student!
I don't have that kind of money!

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.500
Yeah, figures.

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:01.740
Then starting tomorrow, you'll help me work.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.100
You'll work off your debt.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.600
I'm not working for you!

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.360
Don't decide that for me!

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:08.510
I can't exorcise yokai!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:11.380
I'll work a normal job to pay off my debt!

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.740
That won't work.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:17.270
I want a million "en" 
in Underworld currency.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.410
What?

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.600
If you try to run,

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:25.070
I'll send a really nasty yokai 
to collect on your debt.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.280
No way!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:30.120
<i>Did he trick me?</i>

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.290
Congratulations on your recovery!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.280
I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:39.710
Please stop expressing your 
feelings with flowers!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.720
<b>Faculty Office</b>

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.720
This is from my mother.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.880
<b>Sorry my son
made you worry</b>

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.880
She said to give it to my homeroom teacher.

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:48.470
Th-Thanks... I appreciate it.

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:52.480
<i>I can finally attend school like normal.</i>

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:56.190
<i>I'm a little nervous, but I'm excited.</i>

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.320
Your classmate Ashiya, who's been out sick,

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.190
is back at school starting today.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.060
Um, nice to meet you. I'm Ashiya Hanae.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.890
I hope we can be friends.

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:08.450
What?!

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:11.080
You're a dude?

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:11.080
You tricked me!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.240
Nobody tricked anyone.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:17.760
I said he was a dark-haired and 
sickly florist's kid named Hanae.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:20.220
What else could that be but a girl?!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:23.000
Okay, that's all for introductions.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:25.520
Ashiya, your desk is the 
first one by the window.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.460
<i>I made a bad impression.</i>

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:32.490
<i>But I don't want to be alone.</i>

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.480
<i>I need to pull myself together 
and make some friends.</i>

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:40.980
Good morning. I know I'm a week 
late, but it's nice to meet you.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.140
Huh?

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.440
Abeno-san?!

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:52.140
Ashiya, I'm glad you're feeling 
better, but pipe down.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time: "The Ant"</b>

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:28.460
Abeno-san, we're in the same class...

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:29.740
rather, in the same grade...

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:31.800
rather, both high school students?

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:32.330
What?

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:34.930
Oh, no, I'm not saying 
you look old or anything...

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.410
Do you want me to double your debt?

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:39.130
Huh?
